{
  "name": "dsh-mobile-friendly",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Mobile-friendly display adaptation layer for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI — makes the Settings dialog and generic dialogs usable on phones. · DSH Web 界面的移动端显示适配层：让设置弹窗与通用对话框在手机上可用。",
